  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Management of TB/HIV Co-infection</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Melhor gest&#xE3;o da coinfec&#xE7;&#xE3;o TB/HIV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build capacity for joint TB/HIV planning, monitoring and evaluation; provision of routine HIV testing for all TB cases and those with suspected TB, cotrimoxazole preventive therapy, referral of HIV positive TB patients to ARV treatment facilities, intensified TB case finding among PLHA, isoniazid preventive treatment among PLHA, support operational or programmatic research related to TB/HIV collaborative activities. Note: See element HL.2.9 for guidance on infection control, which is often included in TB/HIV activities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Desenvolver capacidades para planeamento, monitoriza&#xE7;&#xE3;o e avalia&#xE7;&#xE3;o conjunta da TB/VIH; fornecimento de testes de VIH de rotina para todos os casos de TB e para aqueles com suspeita de TB, terapia preventiva com cotrimoxazol, encaminhamento de pacientes com TB VIH positivos para instala&#xE7;&#xF5;es de tratamento ARV, intensifica&#xE7;&#xE3;o da detec&#xE7;&#xE3;o de casos de TB entre PVHS, tratamento preventivo com isoniazida entre PVHS, apoio &#xE0; investiga&#xE7;&#xE3;o operacional ou program&#xE1;tica relacionada com actividades de colabora&#xE7;&#xE3;o TB/VIH. Nota: Consulte o elemento HL.2.9 para orienta&#xE7;&#xE3;o sobre controle de infec&#xE7;&#xE3;o, que &#xE9; frequentemente inclu&#xED;do nas atividades de TB/HIV.</narrative>
  </description>
